    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
            "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5,
            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Rosmontis, what are you doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I... I wanna fix this terminal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Six years of memories up to last year... I saved them all in here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "This morning, I went to read the log from June 12, but the screen wouldn't turn on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "What if... what if I can't ever read them again...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "The March 14th log, when I went to the botanical gardens with daddy, or hiking in July, or the time when mommy..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "...Mommy..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "D- don't cry! Listen, you're not great with screens, right?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not wait until Scout can help you fix it? Or Closure?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take it to Closure for you. She'll fix it up lickety-split!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Scout..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Is Scout that one operator who moves around all quiet?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's him! You know him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "With that perfectly polished look... like a porcelain doll."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "There he is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "I had yet to hear your estimation of me. I now understand how weak it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.4,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you get here?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "You could say I have always been here. I am used to concealing myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "So Mr. Scout was here all along."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Why didn't Blaze sense it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I wasn't paying attention. I just didn't notice!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, if you were standing here all this time, why didn't you help her fix it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Forgive me. We are mere moments from undertaking a mission. I must focus my energy on calibrating my weaponry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "You might ask Closure, or the good Mechanist to assist you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you about to go save Dr. {@nickname}?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. You're going too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "It's me we're talking about. If I didn't go, what kind of joke would Rhodes Island's elite operators be?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026",
            "name2": "char_014_riope",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "And what did Ascalon say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026",
            "name2": "char_014_riope",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "The usual. She's not going. Always there with Kal'tsit, that one."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026",
            "name2": "char_014_riope",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Did it ever occur to you... That now is perhaps not the optimal time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026",
            "name2": "char_014_riope",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "But it might be our last chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Chernobog is probably going to turn back deep into Ursus to avoid that Catastrophe. And a rescue operation in the Ursus interior is going to be damn near impossible."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I keep hearing you talk about it, but is this Dr. {@nickname} really worth all this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Worth as much as Amiya and Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "avg_npc_042",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Have I met the Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "avg_npc_042",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Not yet. But you will soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "avg_npc_042",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Good. I want to know what the Doctor is like too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I really, really want to."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "avg_npc_042",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "You will, kitten."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Ace, there's an uninfected girl named GreyThroat on your team."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "I'm aware. She's been training in isolation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Listen, Blaze. I've been working with her for a few months now. She has trouble expressing herself, but she's not a bad person."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked my teammate in the eye and asked, 'How hard could it be to be Infected?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "I know. But it might have been a legitimate question to her. She might really be curious."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "It's not my place to demand an operator turn her opinion on a dime. And GreyThroat has never once questioned orders."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care. I'm not going to stand by and let her insult my teammates, and I sure as hell won't let her disgrace the struggle of the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Now's not the time. I can see the rage you're holding back. But really, not now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.4,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "She said it right in front of me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Take a breath, Big Cat."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "You have a task at hand yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I do."
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. We'll deal with it when you get back."
    },
    {
        "text": "Since when is Ace more senior than me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "When you take that tone, I start to think maybe you're screwing around."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "avg_npc_026",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "She may very well be mocking you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "When he goes two days without shaving, he'll definitely look way more senior."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "char_014_riope",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Ace's beard is very manly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "...Hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha! I have to go move some stuff around. Got my own job to do, you know. Later."
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get a drink when I'm done!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Try not to puke this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Misery spent two hours scrubbing the floor. I wager he would vomit himself when faced with that task again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knew you could hold your liquor so well!"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis, Mechanist will give you back your terminal in a bit."
    },
    {
        "text": "Be a good girl and wait patiently. But don't forget either!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I'll definitely remember! Bye bye!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_026"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scout",
        "text": "Don't burn yourself!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. I can control my own Arts."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
