    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
            "key": "$darkness02_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 3,
            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...How is it you went before me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Ace, was some uninfected girl like GreyThroat really worth training?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "How much trust did we earn? And how much trust did we give?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "If the Doctor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.9
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "What are you saying over there?!;......;If I don't believe in Rhodes Island...?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I'm saying bad things about you. To your face."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "If there's a Doctor hanging around here, hurry up and come out already. You'll need some fancy Arts to hide behind that wall if you don't want me to find you."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Then I'll string you up on a lamppost as bait for Reunion. Don't worry! You won't die. A few bolts and a knife or two never hurt anyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "....sigh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Sigh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Did Amiya send you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Whatever. That's what she's best at. And what she's worst at..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I keep trying to remind her, to get her thinking about how she's still just a kid... it always seems to have the opposite effect."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "I guess she'll never be able to put down that grown up persona of hers as long as she's the leader of Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Of course, if it wasn't Amiya who sent you, if you decided to come keep me company all by yourself, I'm not against the idea."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...Hold me back? Haha! I could carry three of you on my back and I wouldn't even notice. One little Dr. {@nickname} can't hold me back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Hey, look over there."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_building_3",
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
